\b What this installer does\b0\par
Setup copies Thumbwright to Program Files, registers its Explorer thumbnail handlers and right-click tools for all users, and adds a Thumbwright Workbench shortcut to the Start menu. Thumbwright never changes another program's file associations, and uninstalling removes exactly what it added. It makes no network connections.\par
